{
  "id": "tour",
  "feature": "A tour of Sheprd",
  "_comment": "Starts with one space, Home, then opens the demo repo as the forecast space (not shown). Positions are the Moonframe window's at 2560x1440; the classic window's are measured separately where they differ.",
